	(text "TPS27S100A (pin-compatible with this TPS1H100A symbol: VS=IN, IN=EN, ST=FLT, CL=ILIM).\nReverse polarity: GND network 1k || DSK16 (TPS27S100 datasheet 7.3.4.7); ILIM and thermal pad on DGND.\nCurrent limit = 1.233 V x 2000 / R_ILIM: 560 R -> about 4.4 A (+-20 %).\n4.7k series on EN and FLT per datasheet; FLT pull-up lives on the module."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
